{
  "name": "671. ClickHouse log store user agent mappings over the management API (clickhouse user agent mappings)",
  "description": "TXE-6085, upstream 293999f1f (user agent mappings on the ClickHouse log store). The rows run in order on the clickhouse-logstore fixture group: the provider-error gateway with its log store on a real ClickHouse (start-fixture-clickhouse.sh, FIXTURE_CLICKHOUSE_URL). They create a mapping through POST /api/logs/user-agent-mappings, read it back from the list, update it (ClickHouse re-inserts the row under the shared lock, so the list must show exactly one row with the new values), refuse an update and a delete of a missing id with 404, delete it, and read that it is gone. Gated on clickhouseLogstoreFixture; the pattern carries the run's timestamp, and the delete row removes the mapping.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "671.1 setup: GET /api/logs/user-agent-mappings on the ClickHouse store answers a list (clickhouse user agent mappings)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/logs/user-agent-mappings",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "logs",
            "user-agent-mappings"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('clickhouseLogstoreFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('671.1 the ClickHouse-backed list answers 200 with a mappings array', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, pm.response.text()).to.equal(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().mappings, pm.response.text()).to.be.an('array');",
              "});",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('ch_ua_pattern', 'txe6085-ch-cli/' + Date.now());"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "671.2 POST /api/logs/user-agent-mappings creates a mapping (clickhouse user agent mappings)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/logs/user-agent-mappings",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "logs",
            "user-agent-mappings"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"pattern\": \"{{ch_ua_pattern}}\", \"match_type\": \"prefix\", \"app\": \"TXE-6085 CH CLI\", \"is_active\": true}"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('clickhouseLogstoreFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('671.2 create answers 200 with the stored mapping and its id', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, pm.response.text()).to.equal(200);",
              "  const m = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(m.id, pm.response.text()).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "  pm.expect(m.pattern, pm.response.text()).to.equal(pm.collectionVariables.get('ch_ua_pattern'));",
              "  pm.expect(m.app, pm.response.text()).to.equal('TXE-6085 CH CLI');",
              "  pm.expect(m.is_active, pm.response.text()).to.equal(true);",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('ch_ua_id', m.id);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "671.3 GET /api/logs/user-agent-mappings lists the new mapping (clickhouse user agent mappings)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/logs/user-agent-mappings",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
